{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\n香箱蟹釜飯+入口爆漿白子米網卷\n</p>\n<h2>尖沙咀話題割烹x壽司餐廳！</h2>\n<p>最近尖沙咀赫德道開咗一間全新嘅日本料理概念店「Kappo &amp; Sushi Suzaku 壽司·割烹 朱雀」，餐廳由曾主理多場星級客席料理嘅主廚 Li 師傅掌舵，將割烹即席烹調嘅火候掌控，同埋江戶前壽司嘅純粹刀工結合。如果平時晏晝想食好少少，Suzaku 有推出性價比極高嘅「午市板前套餐」（每位$680 ），有齊前菜、精緻蒸物、板前十貫手握壽司，就算係午間時光都可以細味職人手藝。</p>\n<h2>晚市冬季 Tasting Menu！</h2>\n<p>晚市特別推出全新「冬季 Tasting Menu」每位$1,680 ，嚴選日本產地直送海鮮同頂級食材，當中必食焦點「雲子、36 個月巴馬火腿、紫蘇葉米網卷」，將肥美滑嫩嘅白子用輕盈透薄嘅米網紙包裹再炸到金黃酥脆，外層鋪上熟成 36 個月頂級意大利巴馬火腿，白子好似奶油咁豐腴口感；香箱蟹釜飯以原鍋慢火精心燜煮，拌入剔透拆肉的鮮甜蟹肉、金黃濃醇的蟹膏。每顆飽滿米粒均充分吸附蟹香精華與柴魚香味。</p>\n<p>Kappo &amp; Sushi Suzaku(壽司·割烹 朱雀)<br/>\n地址：尖沙咀赫德道 2 號金麟商業大廈 5 樓 �電話：<a>2488 8863</a><br/>\n營業時間：午市時段:中午 12:00 – 下午 2:00； 晚市時段:晚上 7:00 – 晚上 11:00(逢星期三休息)<br/>\n官方IG：@kappo.suzaku</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179584561650277994_11050525056b0a6df12f0c7.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179584561650277994_11050525056b0a6df12f0c7.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179584561868813123_13515357666b0a6df34505e.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179584561868813123_13515357666b0a6df34505e.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179584562100344421_3388212366b0a6df5766ad.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179584562100344421_3388212366b0a6df5766ad.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179584562329260769_8915852416b0a6df7e7a46.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179584562329260769_8915852416b0a6df7e7a46.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179584562530150652_13261199366b0a6df9b15fb.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179584562530150652_13261199366b0a6df9b15fb.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179584562685735130_21146905916b0a6dfb4263b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179584562685735130_21146905916b0a6dfb4263b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179584562870625066_8165802826b0a6dfd3441d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179584562870625066_8165802826b0a6dfd3441d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179584563114846825_13183739956b0a6dff80aeb.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179584563114846825_13183739956b0a6dff80aeb.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<blockquote><p>在 Instagram 查